{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"裁判员：\r\n记录员：\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n蒋川自评，lzc79保存","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"中炮对屏风马，最经典的布局再次上演。这盘汪大师想和我校量什么变化呢？让我们拭目以待。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"为了求胜，我也明知山有虎，偏向虎山行，迎接汪大师的挑战。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"汪大师略作思考，挺起中兵，求胜之心跃然枰上。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"在不久前举行的杨官璘杯上，汪大师在执黑对阵江苏徐超大师时曾采用炮9平7：","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2e3","comment":"此时还有一种攻法是兵三进一，以下黑有象3进5和卒5进1两种选择，另具攻防变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e1","comment":"此着始创于2001年的象棋排位赛。此番汪大师老谱翻新，临场给我带来了很大压力。此时常见变化是马八进七，象3进5，马六进七，车1平3，马七退五，以下黑有卒3进1、车3平4、马7进8等多种选择。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d9","comment":"除此之外，黑方也可走象3进5，以下红有兵七进一、马六进七等攻法。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0a1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h1h4","comment":"较为新颖的一着！以往全国赛中出现的应法基本上都是卒5进1：","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b4","comment":"面对新着，汪大师经过长考，最终炮八进二试探我的应的手。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"此时若走炮2进3，车四进二，马4进5，兵五进一，红方可迅速突破黑方防线。走完这着后，我对局面还挺乐观，于是起身去了趟洗手间，缓解一下紧张的心情。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f8","comment":"此着是进车捉马的后续手段，给以下红方的进攻做了铺垫。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e7","comment":"由于此时我还没有意识到局面的困难，此着导致了局面的被动。应改走炮7平9，红方就没有炮五平八的得子手段了。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1b1","comment":"好棋！当我走了马4进5后，汪大师飞快地走了炮五平八。我中招了！我的心砰地跳了起来。由此我们可看出汪大师布局研究得非常深。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8g4","comment":"从第17回合至今是无奈的着法，只能忍痛弃子。此时进炮希望能组织一些攻势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b8","comment":"命令式着法，压缩黑车的空间。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e9d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b1b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7g6","comment":"败着！在巨大的压力下我出现了大漏。此时我应改走卒5进1，虽然少一子，但多卒，并且位置也不错，还可对红方有所牵制。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f5","comment":"此着一走，黑方必丢一子，我的心情顿时跌入冰点。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5d3","comment":"丢子后，由于不甘心直接认负，我希望再坚持一会儿，另外再缓解一下情绪。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5f3","comment":"汪大师走得非常细致，又白吃我一卒，这样把我的翻盘可能性又降低了一些。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b0","comment":"红认负。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}}